            <div class="content-text">
                
                <ul><li><strong>Object (Clause III):</strong> Special Resolution. MGT-14 only (no INC-24). No RUN. No stamp duty. Fresh COI issued. 10-20 days.</li><li><strong>Name (Clause I):</strong> Special Resolution. MGT-14 + INC-24. RUN required. No stamp duty. Fresh COI issued. 15-20 days.</li><li><strong>Capital (Clause V):</strong> Ordinary Resolution. SH-7 only. No RUN. State stamp duty on increase. No fresh COI (Master Data updated). 7-15 days.</li><li><strong>Key:</strong> Object clause change is simplest of Special Resolution changes - only MGT-14 needed.</li></ul>

